# Okoye, Dora Milaje Leader: "When Okoye enters, create two 1/1 white Soldier creature tokens. Attacking creature tokens you control
# have first strike." Turn 1: Okoye makes two Soldier tokens. Turn 3: Okoye and one Soldier token attack - the attacking token has first
# strike; the token at home does not, nor does Okoye (not a token), and after combat the token has lost it. Turn 4: Bot2's Borg token
# (made by Assembly Specialist) attacks and has none: it is not a token Bot1 controls.

[Bot1 Deck]
Okoye, Dora Milaje Leader
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Assembly Specialist
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Okoye, Dora Milaje Leader.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield = Okoye, Dora Milaje Leader; Mox Jet; Mox Pearl; Mox Ruby; Mox Sapphire; Soldier Token; Soldier Token
? Bot1.Battlefield.Soldier Token#1.Keywords = (absent)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Assembly Specialist.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Okoye, Dora Milaje Leader > Bot2; Soldier Token#1 > Bot2)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Soldier Token#1.Keywords = FirstStrike
? Bot1.Battlefield.Soldier Token#2.Keywords = (absent)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Okoye, Dora Milaje Leader.Keywords = (absent)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Soldier Token#1.Keywords = (absent)
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Attack(Borg Token > Bot1)
? Bot2.Battlefield.Borg Token.Keywords = (absent)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Soldier Token#1.Keywords = (absent)

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Borg Token.Power = 1
